# Image digests — single source of truth (constitution I).
# Copy to digests.env (gitignored) and adjust hosts for your lab.
# Canonical pins below match GitOps as of 2026-10-03.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Lab hosts (replace when mirroring to a new cluster / GitHub-first lab)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# APPS_DOMAIN=apps.<YOUR_CLUSTER_DOMAIN>
# QUAY_HOST=quay.apps.<YOUR_CLUSTER_DOMAIN>
# GITLAB_REPO=https://gitlab-gitlab.apps.<YOUR_CLUSTER_DOMAIN>/fxrate/python-cve-upgrade-demo.git
# NEXUS_HOST=nexus.apps.<YOUR_CLUSTER_DOMAIN>

